title: "Cognitive Diagrams: Reviewing Categorical Accounts of Linguistic Case"
abstract: >-
  Category-theoretic formalization of linguistic case systems, integrating
  categorial grammar, DisCoCat/DisCoCirc distributional semantics, enriched
  categories, and topos theory with the Active Inference framework via the
  CEREBRUM architecture.
